   838                          
   839                          ;======================================================================================
   840                          ; Pseudo-random-number generator. You can get 8-bit
   841                          ; random numbers in A or 16-bit numbers from the zero
   842                          ; page addresses. Leaves X/Y unchanged.
   843                          ;
   844                          ; (36 clock cycles)
   845                          ;
   846                          ; See
   847                          ; https://web.archive.org/web/20250328001550/https://codebase64.org/doku.php?id=base:16bit_xorshift_random_generator
   848                          ; and
   849                          ; https://github.com/markgbeckett/pet/tree/main/examples
   850                          ;======================================================================================
   851                          RAND16:
   852  1406 a511                   lda SEED_MSB                        ; (3)
   853  1408 4a                     lsr			                        ; (2)
   854  1409 a510                   lda SEED_LSB	                    ; (3)
   855  140b 6a                     ror			                        ; (2)
   856  140c 4511                   eor SEED_MSB	                    ; (3)
   857  140e 8511                   sta SEED_MSB	                    ; (3) high part of x ^= x << 7 done
   858  1410 6a                     ror             	                ; (2) A has now x >> 9 and high bit comes from low byte
   859  1411 4510                   eor SEED_LSB	                    ; (3)
   860  1413 8510                   sta SEED_LSB	                    ; (3) x ^= x >> 9 and the low part of x ^= x << 7 done
   861  1415 4511                   eor SEED_MSB	                    ; (3)
   862  1417 8511                   sta SEED_MSB	                    ; (3) x ^= x << 8 done
   863                          
   864  1419 60                     rts			                        ; (6)
   865                          
